-- הוראת תכ"ם H.13.4.7 — החזר הוצאות טלפון קווי אישי (גרסה 2, 1.1.2018)
-- The instruction's second edition. From 1.3.2017 the personal-landline
-- refund is cancelled for every State employee but those on three
-- gradings, doctors (31), defence researchers (43) and teaching employees
-- on gradings 41, 240, 321-329 and 801-824, and for them annex B's
-- criteria are cut down: no more aides, advisers, spokespersons or bureau
-- chiefs. The dated transition of the first edition (the end of the Bezeq
-- contract on 1.4.2009, the new holders' check from 1.12.2008) is gone;
-- the rest is unchanged, and where a rule is the first edition's it is
-- imported from that edition's file rather than written again. The sums
-- are notice HOD.13.4.7.1's second edition.
--
-- Which edition is in force on a day, and the refund on a day across
-- both, are at the end of this file. The corpus dates this edition
-- 1.1.2018; its own table of changes prints 11.02.2018 as the edition's
-- date (annex E), and the encoding takes the corpus's date.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `2008-08-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v1`
IMPORT `2018-01-01_takam_HOD-13-4-7-1_telefon-ramot-zakaut_v2`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: ‘בעל’ is ‘בעל תפקיד’, the
-- holder of a post, not a husband; the instruction refunds phone expenses
-- by grading, post and level, and makes no distinction by sex.

§ `החזר הוצאות טלפון קווי אישי (גרסה 2)`

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- §1.2 and annex B §1: from 1.3.2017 the refund is cancelled for every
-- State employee except those on gradings 31 (doctors) and 43 (defence
-- research), and teaching employees on gradings 41, 240, 321 to 329 and
-- 801 to 824; both ends of a printed range are in it. The instruction now
-- applies only to the holders who kept the entitlement.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3
GIVEN g IS A NUMBER @desc the employee's grading (דירוג)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grading that keeps the landline refund` g IF
       elem g (LIST 31, 43, 41, 240)
    OR (g AT LEAST 321 AND g AT MOST 329)
    OR (g AT LEAST 801 AND g AT MOST 824)

@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1
`the day the landline refund was cancelled` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017

-- §1.1–1.3: role holders in the State service entitled to be paid for
-- using their home landline for work; the instruction applies to those who
-- kept the entitlement, and not to the holders entitled without limit,
-- whose existing arrangements continue.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
      g IS A NUMBER @desc the holder's grading
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the landline instruction of 2018 applies to` h g IF
        `the landline instruction of 2008 applies to` h
    AND `a grading that keeps the landline refund` g

-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-4 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-4/p2 The instruction's purpose: to set the rules for refunding the entitled role holders' personal-landline expenses; no rule of its own.

-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-5 A pointer to the definitions of annex A, encoded there.

§§ `2.1–2.2 הוועדה הבין-משרדית`

-- §2.1: the committee and its three members, unchanged; its chair is the
-- head of the senior division for planning and control at the Civil
-- Service Commission.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-3
`the landline committee's seats in 2018` MEANS
    LIST `the head of the senior division for planning and control at the Civil Service Commission`,
         `a senior deputy to the Accountant-General or his representative`,
         `a senior deputy to the Wages and Labour Agreements Commissioner`

-- §2.2: the committee hears only the exceptional cases that do not meet
-- annex B's criteria, now without a starting day.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2
GIVEN `the case meets annex B` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `the landline committee's reach under §2.2 of 2018` `the case meets annex B` IS
    IF `the case meets annex B`
    THEN PARTY `the inter-ministerial landline committee`
         SHANT `decide a landline case`
    ELSE PARTY `the inter-ministerial landline committee`
         MAY   `decide a landline case`

§§ `2.3 בעל תפקיד קיים`

-- §2.3.1, unchanged: the check of the existing holders against annex B
-- and the referral of those who fail it to the committee.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-1
GIVEN `some existing holders fail annex B` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `the check of the existing landline holders in 2018` `some existing holders fail annex B` IS
    `the check of the existing landline holders` `some existing holders fail annex B`

-- §2.3.2, §2.6.1 and annex D: each entitled holder pays his phone bill
-- directly to a landline company he chooses; the State does not pay the
-- phone company for his home phone. No starting day any more.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6__cls_2-6-1 akn:att_4__hc_1/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `paying the landline bill directly in 2018` IS
    PARTY `the landline role holder`
    MUST  `arrange paying the phone bill directly with a provider of his choice`

@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p7
`the State pays the phone company for the home landline in 2018` MEANS FALSE

-- §2.3.3, §2.4.3 and annex D: the sum approved is taxed in full and
-- reported under annex C, unchanged.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p8
`the landline refund of 2018 is taxed in full` MEANS `the landline refund is taxed in full`

§§ `2.4 בעל תפקיד חדש`

-- §2.4.1: the deputy director-general for administration and the
-- ministry's accountant are responsible for checking that new holders meet
-- annex B, now without a starting day.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `the check of a new landline holder in 2018` IS
    (PARTY `the deputy director-general for administration`
     MUST  `check the new holders against annex B`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the ministry's accountant for the landline refund`
     MUST  `check the new holders against annex B`)

-- §2.4.4, unchanged.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-4
GIVEN `an entitlement was cancelled or its level changed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `telling the accountant of a landline change in 2018` `an entitlement was cancelled or its level changed` IS
    `telling the accountant of a landline change` `an entitlement was cancelled or its level changed`

§§ `2.5–2.6 הצהרה ופרסום`

-- §2.5 and §2.6.2, unchanged: the declaration on approval, renewed every
-- two years, and no refund without it.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-5__cls_2-5-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6__cls_2-6-2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `the landline declaration duty in 2018` IS
    `the landline declaration duty`

-- §2.6, unchanged.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `publishing the landline instruction in the ministry in 2018` IS
    `publishing the landline instruction in the ministry`

-- akn:hc_1__para_3 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2 The list of applicable documents: the notice that prices the levels (imported) and the notice that ends the imputed benefit (not in the corpus); no rule.

-- akn:hc_1__para_4 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-1 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-2 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-3 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-4 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-5 The list of annexes A to E, each encoded where it is printed; no rule.

§§ `נספח א הגדרות`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- Annex A, now with the year in both acting sentences, and the first
-- edition's overlap with it
-- (F-2018-01-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v2-a): an acting holder
-- of 30.11.2008 still acting on 1.12.2008 is existing by ¶2 and new by ¶1.
-- The first edition's rules and its reading (dates.period-by-start) are
-- imported unchanged.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A `landline role-holder standing`
DECIDE `the landline standing in 2018 of` h IS
    `the landline standing of` h

@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `both existing and new under annex A of 2018 as written` h IF
        `a new landline holder under annex A as written` h
    AND `an existing landline holder under annex A as written` h

§§ `נספח ב קריטריונים`

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- Annex B §2 for existing holders: level א at the discretion of the
-- inter-ministerial committee; level ב for senior professional aides to a
-- minister, security officers and district directors; level ג for a deputy
-- director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above, senior
-- division heads and heads of auxiliary units not of director-general
-- standing; level ד for an associate director-general graded 44-46.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-3/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-4 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-4/p2
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A MAYBE `landline entitlement level`
DECIDE `the level annex B of 2018 gives an existing holder` h IS
    CONSIDER h's `the landline post`
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a minister` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a ministry security officer` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a ministry district director` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` THEN JUST `landline level C`
    WHEN `a senior division head` THEN JUST `landline level C`
    WHEN `a head of an auxiliary unit not of director-general standing` THEN JUST `landline level C`
    WHEN `an associate director-general graded 44-46` THEN JUST `landline level D`
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- Annex B §2 for new holders: level א for senior professional aides to a
-- minister, a deputy minister and directors-general
-- (F-2018-01-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v2-b) and security
-- officers; level ב for a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded
-- 42-44 or above, senior division heads, heads of auxiliary units not of
-- director-general standing, and an associate director-general graded
-- 44-46.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-2/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-2/p3
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A MAYBE `landline entitlement level`
DECIDE `the level annex B of 2018 gives a new holder` h IS
    CONSIDER h's `the landline post`
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a minister` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a deputy minister` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a senior professional aide to a director-general` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a ministry security officer` THEN JUST `landline level A`
    WHEN `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a senior division head` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `a head of an auxiliary unit not of director-general standing` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    WHEN `an associate director-general graded 44-46` THEN JUST `landline level B`
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- The level a holder is paid at: annex B's for his post and standing,
-- else the level the committee approved (existing holders' level א, and
-- §2.2's exceptions).
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1/p2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
GIVETH A MAYBE `landline entitlement level`
DECIDE `the landline level of 2018 for` h IS
    orElse (CONSIDER `the landline standing in 2018 of` h
            WHEN `an existing landline role holder` THEN `the level annex B of 2018 gives an existing holder` h
            WHEN `a new landline role holder` THEN `the level annex B of 2018 gives a new holder` h)
           (h's `the landline level the committee approved`)

§§ `הסכום לתשלום`

-- §2.3.3–2.3.4 and §2.4.2 with annex D: a holder the instruction applies
-- to, whose grading kept the refund, with a declaration in force and a
-- landline at home he will use for work, is paid each month the fixed sum
-- notice HOD.13.4.7.1 (second edition) sets for his standing and level.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-4 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p4 akn:att_4__hc_1/p8
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
      g IS A NUMBER @desc the holder's grading
      t IS A DATE   @desc a day of the month paid
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 2` h g t IS
    IF      `the landline instruction of 2018 applies to` h g
        AND `the landline declaration holds on` h t
        AND h's `has a home landline usable for work`
        AND h's `is ready to use the home landline for work`
    THEN CONSIDER `the landline level of 2018 for` h
         WHEN JUST l THEN `the monthly landline sum under notice edition 2` (`the landline standing in 2018 of` h) l
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    ELSE NOTHING

§§ `נספח ג ביצוע התשלום`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- Annex C: paid through Malam payroll, as code 4944, unchanged.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_2/t1
`the payroll code of the landline refund in 2018` MEANS `the payroll code of the landline refund`

§§ `נספח ד הצהרה`

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 The annex's title; no rule.

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p5 "כמו כן, ידוע לי כי:", the line that introduces what the holder acknowledges; the acknowledgements are encoded where they rest.

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/t1 The lines for the holder's name, signature and date; no rule.

-- Annex D's footnote: the salary unit's manager fills in the level and the
-- fixed sum, unchanged.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p9
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `landline action`
DECIDE `completing the landline declaration in 2018` IS
    `completing the landline declaration`

§§ `נספח ה טבלת שינויים`

-- akn:att_5__hc_1/p1 akn:att_5__hc_1/p2 The table's title and caption; no rule.

-- Annex E's one row: edition 2, dated 11.02.2018, changed most of the
-- instruction's and the notice's sections for the changes in the
-- entitlement. The edition is dated here by the corpus (1.1.2018).
@ref akn:att_5__hc_1/t1
`the date annex E of 2018 prints for edition 2` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 11 2 2018

§§ `העדכון שבתוקף`

-- Which edition is in force on a day: none before 1.8.2008, the first
-- until the second, the second from 1.1.2018 (the corpus's dates).
DECLARE `landline instruction edition` IS ONE OF
    `no landline instruction yet`
    `landline instruction edition 1`
    `landline instruction edition 2`

GIVEN t IS A DATE
GIVETH A `landline instruction edition`
DECIDE `the landline instruction edition in force on` t IS
    IF t `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018)
    THEN `landline instruction edition 2`
    ELSE IF t `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2008)
         THEN `landline instruction edition 1`
         ELSE `no landline instruction yet`

-- The refund on a day across both editions. The second edition records a
-- cancellation from 1.3.2017, before its own date: from that day a holder
-- whose grading did not keep the refund is paid nothing, under either
-- edition's rules; otherwise the edition in force on the day pays.
GIVEN h IS A `landline role holder`
      g IS A NUMBER @desc the holder's grading
      t IS A DATE   @desc a day of the month paid
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly landline refund on` h g t IS
    IF      t `is on or after` `the day the landline refund was cancelled`
        AND NOT `a grading that keeps the landline refund` g
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE CONSIDER `the landline instruction edition in force on` t
         WHEN `landline instruction edition 2` THEN `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 2` h g t
         WHEN `landline instruction edition 1` THEN `the monthly landline refund under instruction edition 1` h t
         WHEN `no landline instruction yet` THEN NOTHING

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Dates and posts are placeholders. A deputy director-general appointed
-- 1.1.2005, who signed annex D on 1.4.2009 and renewed it on 1.1.2018;
-- grading 41 is a teaching employee's that kept the refund, 99 one that
-- did not.
`an existing deputy director-general of 2005` MEANS
    `landline role holder` WITH
        `the landline post`                               IS `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above`
        `place among the bureau's aides`                  IS 0
        `took up the landline post on`                    IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2005
        `holds the landline post as acting or substitute` IS FALSE
        `entitled to a landline refund without limit`     IS FALSE
        `the landline level the committee approved`       IS NOTHING
        `signed a landline declaration`                   IS TRUE
        `last signed the landline declaration on`         IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018
        `has a home landline usable for work`             IS TRUE
        `is ready to use the home landline for work`      IS TRUE

-- On grading 41 he is paid level ג's 196.8 in 2018; on grading 99 nothing
-- from 1.3.2017.
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund on` `an existing deputy director-general of 2005` 41 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018) EQUALS JUST 196.8
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund on` `an existing deputy director-general of 2005` 99 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018))
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund on` `an existing deputy director-general of 2005` 99 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2017))

-- The gradings at the ends of each printed range keep it, and the next
-- ones do not.
`the landline gradings' ranges include both ends` MEANS
        all (GIVEN g YIELD `a grading that keeps the landline refund` g) (LIST 31, 43, 41, 240, 321, 329, 801, 824)
    AND all (GIVEN g YIELD NOT `a grading that keeps the landline refund` g) (LIST 320, 330, 800, 825, 42)
#ASSERT `the landline gradings' ranges include both ends`

-- A minister's aide, new since 2009, who last signed on 1.1.2017, has a
-- level under the first edition (א, 96) and none under the second, which
-- dropped the aides, though his declaration still holds; and the
-- second edition prices a new security officer at level א.
`a new aide of 2009 on grading 41` MEANS
    `landline role holder` WITH
        `the landline post`                               IS `an aide to a minister or deputy minister`
        `place among the bureau's aides`                  IS 1
        `took up the landline post on`                    IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009
        `holds the landline post as acting or substitute` IS FALSE
        `entitled to a landline refund without limit`     IS FALSE
        `the landline level the committee approved`       IS NOTHING
        `signed a landline declaration`                   IS TRUE
        `last signed the landline declaration on`         IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2017
        `has a home landline usable for work`             IS TRUE
        `is ready to use the home landline for work`      IS TRUE
`a new security officer of 2009 on grading 41` MEANS
    `landline role holder` WITH
        `the landline post`                               IS `a ministry security officer`
        `place among the bureau's aides`                  IS 0
        `took up the landline post on`                    IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2009
        `holds the landline post as acting or substitute` IS FALSE
        `entitled to a landline refund without limit`     IS FALSE
        `the landline level the committee approved`       IS NOTHING
        `signed a landline declaration`                   IS TRUE
        `last signed the landline declaration on`         IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018
        `has a home landline usable for work`             IS TRUE
        `is ready to use the home landline for work`      IS TRUE
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund on` `a new aide of 2009 on grading 41` 41 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2017) EQUALS JUST 96
#ASSERT isNothing (`the monthly landline refund on` `a new aide of 2009 on grading 41` 41 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018))
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund on` `a new security officer of 2009 on grading 41` 41 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018) EQUALS JUST 96

-- The editions in force on the days around each change.
#ASSERT `the landline instruction edition in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 7 2008) EQUALS `no landline instruction yet`
#ASSERT `the landline instruction edition in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2008) EQUALS `landline instruction edition 1`
#ASSERT `the landline instruction edition in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2017) EQUALS `landline instruction edition 1`
#ASSERT `the landline instruction edition in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018) EQUALS `landline instruction edition 2`

-- F-2018-01-01_takam_H-13-4-7_telefon-kavi-ishi_v2-a: an acting holder of
-- 30.11.2008 still acting after it is both existing and new as annex A is
-- written, and the notice pays the two standings differently at level ג
-- (196.8) and ב (144) for the same post. As read, existing.
`an acting deputy director-general since 1.10.2008` MEANS
    `landline role holder` WITH
        `the landline post`                               IS `a deputy director-general or a parallel post graded 42-44 or above`
        `place among the bureau's aides`                  IS 0
        `took up the landline post on`                    IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2008
        `holds the landline post as acting or substitute` IS TRUE
        `entitled to a landline refund without limit`     IS FALSE
        `the landline level the committee approved`       IS NOTHING
        `signed a landline declaration`                   IS TRUE
        `last signed the landline declaration on`         IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018
        `has a home landline usable for work`             IS TRUE
        `is ready to use the home landline for work`      IS TRUE
`an acting holder of 30.11.2008 is both existing and new as annex A of 2018 is written` MEANS
        `both existing and new under annex A of 2018 as written` `an acting deputy director-general since 1.10.2008`
    AND NOT (`the monthly landline sum under notice edition 2` `an existing landline role holder` `landline level C`
             EQUALS `the monthly landline sum under notice edition 2` `a new landline role holder` `landline level B`)
#ASSERT `an acting holder of 30.11.2008 is both existing and new as annex A of 2018 is written`
#ASSERT `the monthly landline refund on` `an acting deputy director-general since 1.10.2008` 41 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018) EQUALS JUST 196.8

